---
List all custom metrics

Usage: vendo metrics list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --profile <name>   Use a specific account profile
      --status <status>  Filter by status (draft, active, archived)
      --debug            Enable verbose request diagnostics
      --limit <n>        Number of results [default: 20]
      --offset <n>       Pagination offset [default: 0]
      --json             Output raw JSON
      --output <field>   Print a single field per row (e.g. id, name)
  -h, --help             Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo metrics list
  $ vendo metrics list --status active
  $ vendo metrics list --output id
